{"seq":3,"slug":"measuring-progress-benchmarks","title":"测量 AGI 进展：基准与局限","stage":"DONE","category":"agi-frontier","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/measuring-progress-benchmarks","rating":{"composite":4.1,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"测量-agi-进展\">测量 AGI 进展</h1><p>每一条「AI 又刷新了纪录」的新闻背后都站着一个基准。</p>\n<p>而每一个基准背后都站着一串没人细看的方法论决定：题怎么出、人怎么选、分怎么算、以及出题者自己押上了什么。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 讲的就是这条隐秘的因果链——我们如何知道 AGI 离我们还有多远。</p>\n<p>它属于 agi-frontier 系列，但回答的问题与兄弟 hub 严格分工。「AGI 是什么」的定义之争、「能力从哪来」的扩展律逻辑、「递归自我改进会不会起飞」的加速推演，分别在定义、扩展律与递归自改进三个 hub 展开；本 hub 只负责一件事——当有人宣称进展时，你如何判断这个数字值得信多少。</p>\n<p>全 hub 四章构成一条递进的认识链。</p>\n<p>第一章「测量的对象」建立问题域：基准如何一代代更替，为什么所有静态考卷都会饱和死亡，以及哪些能力从一开始就照不进测量的路灯。第二章「前沿基准」盘点 2026 年仍在有效运转的工具：ARC-AGI-2 与 Humanity&#39;s Last Exam 两座推理灯塔、SWE-bench、OSWorld 与 Tau-bench 三条 Agent 战线，以及激励结构最特殊的安全评估。</p>\n<p>第三章「方法论批判」拆穿数字的成色：数据污染与 Goodhart 定律如何掏空分数含义，「超过人类水平」这类断言背后的对照难题，以及把测量锚定到经济价值的艰难尝试。第四章「替代框架」给出建设性答案：用多维能力画像替代单一总分，用竞技场与实战信号交叉验证，最后落到每个从业者都能动手的个人遥测。</p>\n<p>用一句话概括四章的关系：前两章是「是什么」，第三章是「为什么不能全信」，第四章是「那该怎么办」。跳章读会失去论证的连贯性。</p>\n<p>读者画像设定为有三年以上经验的工程师与技术决策者：你不需要机器学习背景，但需要面对真实的选型与判断场景——该不该相信某个发布会的分数、该给团队选哪个模型、该在多大程度上信任安全评估的绿灯。</p>\n<p>推荐路径是按章节顺序通读；时间紧张时，第一章的饱和危机与盲区清单加第三章全部是不可压缩的核心，它们提供的是怀疑的工具而非知识的堆叠。前置要求只有一条：对 LLM 能做什么有基本的体感，用过任何一个聊天模型即可。</p>\n<p>读完之后你未必能预测下一个突破，但你能识破大部分测量幻觉——这正是这个 hub 唯一想教的能力。</p>\n<p>延伸阅读可前往同系列的兄弟 hub：<a href=\"../agi-definitions-debates/\">定义与争论</a>处理概念边界，<a href=\"../scaling-laws-bitter-lesson/\">扩展律与苦涩教训</a>解释能力增长的来源，<a href=\"../recursive-self-improvement/\">递归自我改进</a>推演测量数字最终喂养的那个反馈循环。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-to-measure","title":"测量的对象","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/measuring-progress-benchmarks/what-to-measure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"benchmark-generations","title":"基准代际：从 MMLU 到 GPQA 到 ARC-AGI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/measuring-progress-benchmarks/what-to-measure/benchmark-generations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"saturation-crisis","title":"饱和危机与基准寿命","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/measuring-progress-benchmarks/what-to-measure/saturation-crisis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"what-benchmarks-cannot-see","title":"基准看不见的东西","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/measuring-progress-benchmarks/what-to-measure/what-benchmarks-cannot-see"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"frontier-benchmarks","title":"前沿基准","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/measuring-progress-benchmarks/frontier-benchmarks","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reasoning-frontiers","title":"推理前沿：ARC-AGI-2 与 Humanity's Last Exam","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/measuring-progress-benchmarks/frontier-benchmarks/reasoning-frontiers"},{"seq":2,"slug":"agentic-benchmarks","title":"Agent 基准：SWE-bench、OSWorld 与 Tau-bench","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/measuring-progress-benchmarks/frontier-benchmarks/agentic-benchmarks"},{"seq":3,"slug":"safety-evaluations","title":"安全评估作为测量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/measuring-progress-benchmarks/frontier-benchmarks/safety-evaluations"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"methodology-critique","title":"方法论批判","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/measuring-progress-benchmarks/methodology-critique","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"contamination-goodhart","title":"数据污染与 Goodhart 定律","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/measuring-progress-benchmarks/methodology-critique/contamination-goodhart"},{"seq":2,"slug":"human-comparison-problem","title":"人类对照难题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/measuring-progress-benchmarks/methodology-critique/human-comparison-problem"},{"seq":3,"slug":"toward-real-value","title":"迈向经济价值的测量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/measuring-progress-benchmarks/methodology-critique/toward-real-value"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"alternative-frameworks","title":"替代框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/measuring-progress-benchmarks/alternative-frameworks","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"capability-profiles","title":"能力画像而非总分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/measuring-progress-benchmarks/alternative-frameworks/capability-profiles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"live-competition-signal","title":"竞技场与实战信号","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/measuring-progress-benchmarks/alternative-frameworks/live-competition-signal"},{"seq":3,"slug":"practitioner-telemetry","title":"从业者视角：读自己的遥测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/measuring-progress-benchmarks/alternative-frameworks/practitioner-telemetry"}]}]}